<div  id="experience-row">
<div class="container">
<h2>An Unforgettable luxury experience</h2>
	<div class="row row-lightup-full">
	<div class="col-md-4">
		<p>Good packaging can do more than just protect products - it has the power to set expectations, and create a feeling of luxury that customers associate with quality. </p>
</div>
			<div class="col-md-4">
		<p>Custom rigid boxes are an effective way to showcase your product's value through stunning visuals and luxurious designs – adding sophistication as well as security and protection. </p>
</div>
		</div>
	 <div class="linkbtn"><a href="#rigidproducts" class="right-arrow" style="line-height: initial;" >Browse more styles </a></div> 
	
